a_consume_parameter_of_an_element_names_its_container_at_depth_1.vyrn:1:0: `b.xs[0]` may not be passed to a `consume` parameter via `take(..)` — it is read out of a place that owns it
  fix: `b.xs[0].copy()` — the callee owns its copy
  fix: `b.xs.swapRemove(..)` returns the element and leaves the container one shorter
